
mint form
  case name
    site name
  case head, mint head
    site head
  case like, mint like
    site like
  case link, mint link
    site link
  case case, mint case
    site case
  case bond, mint bond
    site bond
  case rein
    site rein
  case task, mint task
    site task
  case hold, mint hold
    site hold
  case hide
    site hide
  case fold
    site fold
  case note, mint note
    site note
  case tag, mint tag
    site tag
  hook make
    make form
      bind name, read name
      bind head, read head
      bind like, read like
      bind link, read link
      bind case, read case
      bind bond, read bond
      bind rein, read rein
      bind task, read task
      bind hold, read hold
      bind hide, read hide
      bind fold, read fold
      bind note, read note
      bind tag, read tag

mint bond
  case name
    site name
  case line
    site line
  case call, mint call
    site call
  hook make
    make bond
      bind name, read name
      bind line, read line
      bind call, read call
